{"id":281572705,"title":"8.Day11","summary":"1.React+Ts基础环境创建我们要创建一个react-ts的模板，所以要把这里面的vue替换了。","content":"<p><strong>1.React+Ts基础环境创建</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385486187-c9bcf935-a2e0-4d2d-998d-ba881a5d6155.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要创建一个react-ts的模板，所以要把这里面的vue替换了。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385588061-a75d2168-5edc-45be-978b-28f7b9691115.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385656013-aeeb44e1-7ff6-438e-afbe-32d671801ede.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>去安装包<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385674413-2645cbb4-ec4e-42af-bac3-f6019ed51983.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们来启定一下<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385715438-0bf8405a-f912-4c57-b655-1e9fd3440c06.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们保留这三个就好了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385754644-0f51adfc-fac4-4201-9bec-2e3bfb016660.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385785693-f7f5915c-6be4-472b-b4b2-5c8ef6162e48.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787500503514-fcabf479-3120-4442-9769-ea7df0641084.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385798218-3b2b4f51-600d-463d-9ac3-370028d06606.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>2.useState--自动推导</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385861196-75d17b73-6baf-4bc6-a74c-ccc42e84f00e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787386096671-7b67ffc5-c268-42bf-9296-b78205b2ce04.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>3.useState--泛型参数</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787386601767-19ad228a-ff63-4ae1-93f9-a44646e03bd3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787386875191-db59a849-80ef-4aec-b5a7-98ccfd119d42.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787386892053-53a0d21f-cd8b-4616-bc74-0444fc01e943.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787387070736-9722bc52-1eb8-412f-bc58-08236201c834.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787387232384-124483f9-a6ff-4842-8d08-c6e33e617a74.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>4.useState--初始值为null</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787387457325-5a91ef91-376a-4614-910b-b1a574d50a71.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787387590783-5ac48e48-0be6-42de-9bec-51d67932efe6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>5.props与Ts--基础使用</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787387740088-fb7daeb2-88cf-4537-a3b0-0bdf62323586.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787388024215-2c7658b2-85bb-40d2-b57c-262b78d92959.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这两个的写法和作用是差不多的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787388063781-b604d7d9-3c04-4ed1-892d-8021530628d3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>6.props与Ts--特殊的children属性</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787388138350-3c1f7de9-aac2-4e4f-9dc1-a2f628813f79.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787388258272-a1890bb2-1bc5-4c89-a7fa-be9b8b12adc1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>7.props与Ts--为事件prop添加类型</strong></p>\n<p>右边上面那个是内敛绑定的，下面那个是单独绑定的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787388326380-96d8bc4d-f514-4af7-8dd7-de70d16290e9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787388847127-ab56d7a7-9b20-4c25-89f3-b458f3a71673.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>8.useRef与Ts</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787388929082-2ef06ddf-3082-4c24-ac84-3284cdd2602c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787389107977-f307203f-b008-48a5-a093-16d0c5503654.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787389065421-ba496c56-ca8e-483f-a982-242396e27392.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787389194113-da6162fb-a67f-4bd5-903d-4bd63fe2435c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82407692,"category":{"id":82407692,"name":"React","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-16T16:19:04.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-23T15:55:11.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/rlg5dd/tkkcqhc77g90cdr2","slug":"tkkcqhc77g90cdr2","wordCount":138}